{"id":"word:hebrew:H2205","type":"word","title":"זָקֵן","subtitle":"H2205 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"old","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to זָקֵן (H2205) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: a.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 179 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"זָקֵן (zâqên) means old First listed occurrence: 1Chr 11 3."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"זָקֵן","transliteration":"zâqên","pronunciation":"zaw-kane'","strong":"H2205","lemmaId":"hebrew:H2205","partOfSpeech":"a","forms":["זִקְנֵ֣י","זִקְנֵ֥י","זִקְנֵ֤י","זִקְנֵ֨י","הַ/זְּקֵנִ֗ים"],"morphs":[["HAampc",62],["HTd/Aampa",21],["HAamsa",20],["HR/Aampc",14],["HAampa",13],["HC/Aampc",8],["HTd/Aamsa",6],["HC/Td/Aampa",5],["HC/Aampa",4],["HC/Aamsa",3]]},"definitions":{"short":"old","usage":"aged, ancient (man), elder(-est), old (man, men and...women), senator.","full":"H2205. zaqen זָקֵן adjective old , absolute ׳ז Gen 19:4 30 t. (on distinction from verb see above); construct זְקַן 24:2 ; plural זְקֵנִים 18:11 44t.; זְקֵנוֺת Zech 8:4 ; construct זִקְנֵי Gen 50:7 85t.; suffix זְקֵנַי Lam 1:19 , זְקֵנֶיךָ Deut 21:2 ; 32:7 , זְקֵנָיו Josh 8:33 3 t., זְקֵנֶיהָ Judg 8:14 , זְקֵנֵינוּ Exod 10:9 ; Josh 9:11 , זִקְנֵיכֶם Deut 5:20 2 t.; — 1 old , of human beings, as adjective predicate Gen 18:11 (J), Job 32:4 ( ׳ז לְיָמִים מִמֶּנּוּ , in comparison), or attributive זָקֵן אָב Gen 44:20 (J), ז ׳אִישׁ Judg 19:16-17 , 20 , 22 , ז ׳נָבִיא 1Kin 13:11 , 25 , 29 , ז ׳מֶלֶךְ Eccl 4:13 ; probably also ׳ז ימים וּשְׂבַע Gen 35:29 (P), Job 42:17 and Gen 25:8 (P) according to ᵐ5 Sam Di; compare also Ezra 3:12 . 2 usually as substantive: a. old man (or woman), b. elder ; a. old man Gen 43:27 (J), Lev 19:32 (H), Deut 28:50 ; 32:7 (|| אָב ), 1Sam 2:31-32 , 28:14 ; Isa 47:6 ; Job 12:20 ; 32:9 ; Prov 17:6 ; 20:29 ; Psa 119:100 ; Joel 1:2 ; old men and old women Zech 8:4 (twice in verse); compare בֵּיתוֺ זְקַן Gen 24:2 (J), בֵיתוֺ זִקְנֵי 2Sam 12:17 ; especially opposed to נַעַר Exod 10:9 (E), Isa 3:5 ; 20:4 ; Jer 51:22 ; Lam 2:21 ; Psa 148:12 , and in phrase זָקֵן וְעַד מִנַּעַר Gen 19:4 (J), Josh 6:21 (JE), Est 3:13 ; opposed to ילדים 1Kin 12:6 , 8 , 13 2Chr 10:6 ; 10:8 ; 10:13 ; opposed to בַּחוּרִים Jer 31:13 ; Ezek 9:6 ; Joel 3:1 , compare 2Chr 36:17 (+ יָשֵׁשׁ ) and Jer 6:11 (+ ימים מְלֵא ); opposed to ימים עוּל Isa 65:20 ; opposed to שׁדים יונקי and עוללים Joel 2:16 . b. usually plural elders , as having authority, term techn. (100 t. +); elders of a people, especially Israel Exod 3:16 , 18 ; 12:21 (all J), 17:5-6 , 18:12 ; 19:7 ; 24:1 , 9 , 14 ; Josh 24:1 (all E), Num 11:16 (twice in verse) ( שֹׁטְרָיו ), 11:24 ; 11:25 ; 11:30 ; 16:25 ; Josh 7:6 ; 8:10 ; 9:11 (all J E), Deut 5:20 (|| שִׁבְטֵיכֶם רָאשֵׁי ), 27:1 ; 29:9 (|| שֹׁטְרֵיכֶם שׁבטיכם, ראשׁי ), 31:9 , 28 ; Josh 8:33 (|| וְשֹׁפְטָיו שֹׁטְרִים ), 23:2 (|| שֹׁטְרָיו שֹׁפְטָיו, רָאשׁיו, ); compare also probably 24:31 = Judg 2:7 (all D); Lev 9:1 , compare הָעֵדָה זִקְנֵי 4:15 ( both P), Judg 21:16 ; see also 1Sam 4:3 ; 8:4 ; 15:30 ; 2Sam 3:17 ; 5:3 = 1Chr 11:3 ; 2Sam 17:4 , 15 ; 1Kin 8:1 , 32 Chronicles 5:2, 4, also 1Chr 15:25 ; 21:16 ; compare Isa 3:2 ( וְז וְקֹסֵם וְנָבִיא ׳שׁוֺפֵט מִלְחָמָ֑ה וְאִישׁ גִּבּוֺר ), 9:14 (|| נְשׂוּאפָֿנִים , but see probably gloss, compare Ew Che Di Du and others); elders of one tribe (Judah) 1Sam 30:26 ; 2Sam 19:12 , so of Gilead Judg 11:5 , 7 , 8 , 9 , 10 , 11 ; after the division of the kingdoms, of Northern Israel הארץ זקני 1Kin 20:7 compare 20:8 , also 2Kin 6:32 (twice in verse); 10:1 (|| שָׂרִים etc.) compare 10:5 ; under Josiah יְהוּדָה זקני 23:1 2Chr 34:29 ; see also ׳ז הארץ Jer 26:17 , compare ארץ זקני Prov 31:23 , compare Lam 1:19 ; 2:10 ; 4:16 ; 5:12 , 14 (|| שׂרים ; + שַׁעַר ); often in Ezek.: Ezek 7:26 (|| כהן ), of Judah 8:1 , of Israel 8:11-12 , 14:1 ; 20:1 , 3 , also 9:6 (but strike out Co). Exilic ׳ז הַגּוֺלָה Jer 29:1 (|| הנביאים הכהנים, ); post-exile Ezra 10:8 (|| שׂרים ), possibly also Joel 1:14 ; elders of ׳י Isa 24:23 (compare Exod 24:1 , 9 ), הַכֹּהֲנִים זִקְנֵי 2Kin 19:2 = Isa 37:2 , so Jer 19:1 (|| העם זקני ); of other peoples, Midian Num 22:4 , 7 , Moab 22:7 (all E), Egypt Psa 105:22 (|| שׂרים ); of Gebal Ezek 27:9 ; elders of a city, especially as sitting in the gate to judge Deut 19:12 ; 21:2 (+ שֹׁפְטֶיךָ ) 21:3 ; 21:4 ; 21:6 ; 21:19 (+ שַׁעַרמְֿקֹמוֺ ), 21:20 ; 22:15 (+ הַשָּׁ֑עְרָה ), 22:16 ; 22:17 ; 22:18 ; 25:7 (+ הַשַּׁ֫עֲרָה ), 25:8 ; 25:9 (all in Deuteronomic code, and only so therein), Ruth 4:2 , 4 , 9 , 11 (compare שַׁעַר 4:1 ; 4:11 ), זְקֵנִים מוֺשַׁב Psa 107:32 (|| קְהַלעָֿ֑ם ); Judg 8:14 (|| שׂרים ), 8:16 ; 1Sam 11:3 ; 16:4 ; 1Kin 21:8 , 11 ; Ezra 10:14 .","rootNote":"from 2204 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 11 3","keyReferences":["1Chr 11 3","1Chr 15 25","1Chr 21 16","1Kgs 8 1","1Kgs 8 3","1Kgs 12 6","1Kgs 12 8","1Kgs 12 13"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":179,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 11 3","book":"1Chr","chapter":11,"verse":3,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"זִקְנֵ֨י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAampc"},{"reference":"1Chr 15 25","book":"1Chr","chapter":15,"verse":25,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/זִקְנֵ֥י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Aampc"},{"reference":"1Chr 21 16","book":"1Chr","chapter":21,"verse":16,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/הַ/זְּקֵנִ֛ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Td/Aampa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 8 1","book":"1Kgs","chapter":8,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"זִקְנֵ֣י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAampc"},{"reference":"1Kgs 8 3","book":"1Kgs","chapter":8,"verse":3,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"זִקְנֵ֣י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAampc"},{"reference":"1Kgs 12 6","book":"1Kgs","chapter":12,"verse":6,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/זְּקֵנִים֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Aampa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 12 8","book":"1Kgs","chapter":12,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWor